# ArtAddress (OpAddress, 0x6000): reconfigure a node. 0x7f leaves a
# switch alone; bit 7 set programs it.

# Rename only; every switch left alone.
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 60 00 0e 7f 01 54 72 75 73 73 20 31 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 55 70 73 74 61 67 65 20 74 72 75 73 73 20 64 69 6d 6d 65 72 73 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 7f 7f 7f 7f 7f 7f 7f 7f 7f ff 00 => address v14 net 0x7f sub 0x7f bind 1 "Truss 1" "Upstage truss dimmers" out [127, 127, 127, 127] command 0x00

# Move output port 1 to 2:3:4 and cancel merge (command 0x01).
41 72 74 2d 4e 65 74 00 00 60 00 0e 82 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 7f 7f 7f 7f 84 7f 7f 7f 83 ff 01 => address v14 net 0x82 sub 0x83 bind 1 "" "" out [132, 127, 127, 127] command 0x01
